        "title": "What if... Have you ever wondered what you would do if you were rich? I have. If I were rich, I would be using my money to start helping people, and not by giving them money per se, but giving them opportunities to study or prepare themselves. I would also open a foundation to help people develop their skills if they were willing to perfect and offer what they do. For sure, I would not use it just for that, but If I had enough money, I would definitely travel to meet new places and people. Haven’t you given it a thought? If I were you, I would start considering it just in case.",
